### Become a Partner:

Partners are the heart of the Samvera Community. Partnership gives you access to participation in Samvera governance and the ability to help shape community strategy. You also receive special benefits as a Partner, including:

* [Annual Custom Upgrade Planning Service](#New-Samvera-Partner-benefit-the-Hyrax-and-Hyku-Upgrade-Planning-Service)
* Organization-wide discounts on paid event fees
* Invitation to monthly Partner call to advise the Samvera Board
* Eligibility to serve on the Samvera Board
* Voting rights in annual Samvera Board elections 

Partnership has annual contribution dues based on institution or organization size ($525 / $1,050 / $5,250 / $7,825 / $10,500). To become a Partner fill out the [Partnership Request Form](https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdi20pC9C9gBjHyf2lqQlYVJ4qyTUWNXxNiEQI3Qnt-MyD5xg/viewform?usp=header) or learn more on the [Partnership Dues page on the Samvera Wiki].(https://samvera.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/samvera/pages/1872461833/About+Samvera+Partners)

### Become a Sustaining Partner

Sustaining Partner - $14,000+ annual sustaining contribution

* Special recognition at virtual and in person conferences
* All benefits of Partnership

