## Special Partnership Offerings for Service Provider & Consortial Partners
**Service Provider Partner:** 
for commercial and nonprofit service providers and consortia who want to show their commitment to the community. Annual contribution is based on total billable hours. 

All of the above listed Partnership benefits, plus:

* Service Provider Partner logo use
* Priority listing on [Samvera.org](Samvera.org) service provider page
* Option to receive requests for demos and RFPs submitted to the community or collected from the Hyku website

## Become a Samvera Supporter
Partnership is a low annual cost for very small and small institutions and organizations. If Partnership is not an option for your larger institution or organization, you can become a Samvera Supporter. Samvera Supporters are doing their part to support the community they rely on, and receive additional benefits:

* Discounted hourly rate for technical consulting services
* Recognition on the Samvera website and in the annual report

Supporters provide a minimum $2,500+ annual sustaining contribution. Supporters located in World Bank-classified low- or lower-middle-income economies may contribute $1,250 (50% reduction) to reflect appropriate market rates.
[Become a Samvera Supporter](https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfYiWJJm7hP3SNzscXmsJDeQUtdqBPXJvc4Q3KtFXnLPHPr_A/viewform?usp=header)

